{#- The day's record input (subconscious/day_record.py), a projection: every object shows its label of this call and
    its data, never its id; times local. Expects agent_input: day, now, events [{ref, title, start_utc, end_utc, state,
    basis, note, shown_by}], milestones [{at_utc, description, basis, origin, shown_by}], concerns [{ref, title,
    subject, history}] (persist.history_for_prompt), matters (day_tasks.matters_today, each with ref). -#}
{%- set A = agent_input -%}
{#- What showed a state or a milestone: the labels of what is shown here; what it rested on that this call no longer
    shows has an empty label and is said in words. -#}
{%- macro shown(by) -%}
{%- set seen = by | select | list -%}
{%- if by %} [shown by {{ (seen + (["something no longer shown here"] if seen | length < by | length else [])) | join(", ") }}]{% endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
Now: {{ A.now | local_time }}{% if A.current %}; {{ A.current.words }}{% endif %}

## The day's record ({{ A.day }})

Events:
{% for e in A.events -%}
- [{{ e.ref }}] {{ e.title }}{% if e.start_utc %}, {{ e.start_utc | local_time }}{% endif %}{% if e.end_utc %} to {{ e.end_utc | local_time }}{% endif %}: {{ e.state | replace("_", " ") }}{% if e.time_is_now %} (its time is now){% endif %}{% if e.basis %} ({{ e.basis }}){% endif %}{% if e.note %}: {{ e.note }}{% endif %}{{ shown(e.shown_by) }}
{% else -%}
(nothing on the record yet)
{% endfor %}
Milestones recorded:
{% for m in A.milestones -%}
- {{ m.at_utc | local_time }}: {{ m.description }} ({{ m.basis }}{% if m.origin == "sleep" %}, from the sleep data{% elif m.origin == "activity" %}, from the activity data{% endif %}){{ shown(m.shown_by) }}{% if m.origin == "model" and not m.shown_by %} [nothing recorded shows it]{% endif %}
{% else -%}
(none yet)
{% endfor %}
## The open concerns
Each with its record, oldest first: a summary of the older notes, then every note since, each with when it was written.
{% for c in A.concerns -%}
### [{{ c.ref }}] {{ c.title }} (about {{ c.subject }})
{{ c.history }}

{% else -%}
(none)
{% endfor %}
{% with matters = A.matters %}{% include 'shared/brain/matters_today.j2' %}{% endwith %}

Record what the day as now known changes, and what happened that is not yet recorded.
